USAGE:
  COMMAND [COMMANDS] <OPTIONS>

COMMANDS:
  [build]
  clean [OPTIONS]          Clean build artifacts
  lint                     Run linter

For more info, run any command with the `--help` flag:
  COMMAND --help
  COMMAND clean --help
  COMMAND lint --help

OPTIONS:
  -h, --help             Display this help message
  -v, --version          Display this version

